{"year":"2022","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"The 28th edition was held on February 27, 2022, at the Barker Hangar in Santa Monica, broadcast by <i>TNT</i> and <i>TBS</i>. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 776503, 'screen_type': movie}\">CODA</a> (2021) won the cast award, and its deaf actors became the first performers with disabilities nominated in that category; <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1571661, 'screen_type': person}\">Troy Kotsur</a>, the first deaf actor nominated individually, won the supporting actor award. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 15735, 'screen_type': person}\">Helen Mirren</a> received the lifetime achievement award. <i>Television awards are not included.</i>"},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Picture","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":776503,"name":"No Ritmo do Coração","image_path":"/fXeWSHLlAEsINva6SJgb5hCLBzy.jpg","director":"Sian Heder","winner":true,"backdrop_path":"/v85FlkbMYKa5du1glm0YfYNsL2n.jpg"},{"type":"movie","id":777270,"name":"Belfast","image_path":"/3mInLZyPOVLsZRsBwNHi3UJXXnm.jpg","director":"Kenneth Branagh","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":646380,"name":"Don't Look Up","image_path":"/6Sc7Tjt7aPsdghYK32mDMFeZkqJ.jpg","director":"Adam McKay","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":644495,"name":"House of Gucci","image_path":"/dAPdK3L2STpHo4DFKwtL2gdo89L.jpg","director":"Ridley Scott","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":614917,"name":"King Richard","image_path":"/KUdG6W99PfHe3wzuBWgfsHUuM.jpg","director":"Reinaldo Marcus Green","winner":false}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Actress","nominee_list":[{"type":"person","id":83002,"name":"Jessica Chastain","image_path":"/eQKnihReJeB9vQEa5gySzAlKfZt.jpg","winner":true,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":601470,"name":"Os Olhos de Tammy Faye","image_path":"/bxb83Bf5jLLzAv2CsXdRrAtHPNI.jpg","director":"Michael Showalter","backdrop_path":"/rskVKmBb83u7qbaASCxyJyLevkq.jpg"}},{"type":"person","id":39187,"name":"Olivia Colman","image_p